{"availability":"available","full":"aghyad97/browserytools","name":"browserytools","description":"152 free browser-based tools in 17 languages. Your files and text are processed in your browser — no uploads, no accounts, no ads. Image & on-device AI tools, PDF, converters, formatters, calculators, generators. Some AI tools download model weights on first use.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":694,"forks":80,"created":"2025-02-18T13:34:20Z","updated":"2026-09-19T18:29:15Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://browserytools.com","topics":["browser-tools","client-side","i18n","nextjs","no-signup","pdf-tools","privacy","tools","transformers-js","typescript"],"demo":null,"color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T21:19:05.743Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T21:19:05.743Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-03T21:19:05.743Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:19:05.743Z","stars":694,"forks":80}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:38:48.539Z","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A comprehensive collection of 152 browser-based tools built with Next.js, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS. Your files and text are processed in your browser — no uploads, no accounts required. Includes on-device AI tools (transcription, translation, summarization, image upscaling, and more) powered by Transformers.js.","Free, no accounts, no ads, no tracking. If it saves you time, star the repo. That is the fastest way to help other people find it.","Two caveats worth stating plainly, since \"everything is local\" is the headline claim:"],"features":["Tools that run an AI model download the model weights from a third-party CDN the first time you use them. Your content still stays on your device; the model files come over the network.","Two tools genuinely need the network. Live Dictation uses the browser's Web Speech API, which in Chrome and Edge sends your audio to the browser vendor for recogni